      "value": "<p>The chocobo knight adds half of his chocobo knight level as a bonus to Ride checks to fast mount/dismount. If the total bonus to these checks (including from this talent) exceeds +19, he automatically succeeds all fast mount/dismount attempts and may attempt them as free actions. Additionally, the chocobo knight always counts as mounted for the purposes of class features and feats that apply to mounted charges.</p>",
